# Resume layout verification

Text bugs are not layout. Do not rewrite eight templates' CSS to fix a comma.

- Space above the next section title must match Classic: about 16px from the last skill pill to the next heading. A ~2px gap is a fail.
- Do not change `.resumake-classic-skills-grid` or `.resumake-classic-skill-level` to fix Shaded headers. That moves Classic.
- Fix only that template's heading class (e.g. `.academic-shaded-header` margin-top).
- Done only if: browser sample resume; contact line matches the joining helpers; skill-to-next-heading gap ≥ 12px; Classic gap did not shrink.
- Production still shows only Classic and Shaded until a template passes this pass. Then unhide it in `TemplateSelector`.
- One template per visual pass. Do not mix shared-text work with spacing CSS.
